              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Teneibungi oltung'ani etupurroyie obo loo lalashera lenyena, lelo tung'ana le Israel, naa tenelo aiko ninye anaa orrindik aashu emir ninye, neari ilo apurroni metua; pee itum aiwuang'ie entorroni te mpolos inyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
