                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Meari ilpayiani metuata te nkaraki nkera enye, nemeari nkera metuata te nkaraki iloo menye; oltung'ani ake neari metua te nkaraki eng'oki enye makewan.",
          "type": "text",
